    <statement><p>What is the unit vector for the vector <m>\langle -17,-16,18 \rangle</m>?</p>
<p>Answer: <m>\langle</m><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/>,<fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0002"/>,<fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0003"/><m>\rangle</m></p>
